WEBVTT

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:29.490
Oh, so you want to rampage, too?

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:32.930
Sure, rampage all you want.

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:41.030
Give those foolish people who wander into your world a 'warm' greeting.

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:50.810
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:00:50.810 --> 00:00:54.780
<i>We dash across the skies</i>

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:57.290
<i>You are my star</i>

00:00:57.290 --> 00:01:01.790
<i>A priceless love</i>

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:07.600
<i>El Dorado,</i> <i>rising up above the dust clouds</i>

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:11.530
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:19.640
<i>The dream I saw before I awoke</i>

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:26.950
<i>Will surely come true,</i> <i>so never forget it</i>

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:32.490
<i>Searching for a sliver in time passing by</i>

00:01:32.490 --> 00:01:39.620
<i>Where I belong, those days are over now</i>

00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:45.100
<i>Silhouettes outlining the shapes of clouds</i>

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:47.540
<i>Farther and farther</i>

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:54.480
<i>I want to keep looking for</i> <i>the promised land I saw in my dreams</i>

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:56.740
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:01:56.740 --> 00:02:00.820
<i>Like a shining arrow</i>

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:03.320
<i>You are my star</i>

00:02:03.320 --> 00:02:07.860
<i>Unfailing strength</i>

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:13.660
<i>The panorama that spreads before us,</i> <i>beyond the darkness</i>

00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:16.560
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:02:53.030 --> 00:02:54.660
It's morning...

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:05.510
Huh? No water is coming out...

00:03:05.510 --> 00:03:07.980
Yuufa, good morning.

00:03:07.980 --> 00:03:09.640
Yuufa?

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:16.650
Yuufa...

00:03:17.890 --> 00:03:19.090
Yuufa?

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:20.650
Do you have water in your-

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:24.990
Ow...

00:03:26.030 --> 00:03:28.330
What's this?

00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:38.210
--Oh my...

00:03:38.210 --> 00:03:39.680
Who's there?

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:50.360
Huh? Y-Yuufa!

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:52.360
Good morning!

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:56.350
I love the morning breeze!

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:12.980
I'll go buy some fruits or something!

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:29.060
It's true.

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:31.130
I really did see it.

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:33.740
It doesn't matter whether or not you believe me.

00:04:33.740 --> 00:04:36.470
I definitely did see it.

00:04:36.470 --> 00:04:41.840
A gold-colored thief bug deep in the Prontera underground sewers!

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:45.750
Underground sewers?

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:47.980
That's right. In the underground sewers!

00:04:47.980 --> 00:04:51.020
They say thief bugs have been multiplying there these days.

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:54.290
Now even a gold-colored thief bug has appeared.

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:57.190
People are saying they're the reason why there's no water.

00:04:57.190 --> 00:04:59.060
Bugs?

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:00.430
Don't worry!

00:05:00.430 --> 00:05:02.860
I've already gotten permission to enter the sewers!

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:04.930
That's not the problem...

00:05:04.930 --> 00:05:06.670
We'll be fine.

00:05:06.670 --> 00:05:10.140
Didn't we defeat the clock tower manager?

00:05:10.140 --> 00:05:12.570
But...

00:05:12.570 --> 00:05:17.150
Don't worry! I'll be with you!

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:22.780
Yes, but before we go,
I want to ask you the usual favor.

00:05:22.780 --> 00:05:24.520
Again?!

00:05:24.520 --> 00:05:28.650
Yes, it has to be you.

00:05:31.030 --> 00:05:34.230
That hurts... not so hard..

00:05:34.230 --> 00:05:36.490
Be more gentle...

00:05:37.700 --> 00:05:40.800
Ahh... ooh...

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:44.510
You're good, Roan!

00:05:44.510 --> 00:05:47.780
You can do this by yourself...

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:51.980
But I can't do it this nicely.

00:05:51.980 --> 00:05:54.350
Oh boy...

00:06:04.890 --> 00:06:08.830
Roan, don't walk so fast!

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:12.300
Geez! Can't you walk any faster?

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:17.300
But... I want to go home!

00:06:23.710 --> 00:06:25.300
How was that?

00:06:28.850 --> 00:06:31.020
You're afraid, Yuufa...

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:33.320
Not!

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:42.660
Why you!

00:06:55.580 --> 00:06:57.750
Are you all right?

00:06:57.750 --> 00:07:00.280
Y-Yes...

00:07:00.280 --> 00:07:03.480
Thank you for saving us.

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:07.290
Isn't this place a bit too much for you?

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:09.190
Never get in over your head.

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:11.630
We're not in over our heads!

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:15.000
I hear you. Good luck.

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:18.430
If you become frightened, it's best you leave.

00:07:18.430 --> 00:07:22.170
Just wait and see,
I'll defeat the golden thief bug.

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:26.710
Poring!

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:28.640
What's a Poring doing here?

00:07:29.740 --> 00:07:30.970
Hey, wait!

00:07:32.310 --> 00:07:34.650
Don't leave me here!

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:42.990
I said wait for me!

00:07:49.930 --> 00:07:52.870
What's he doing?

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:54.670
P-Poring!

00:07:55.770 --> 00:07:59.770
He... lp... me!

00:07:59.770 --> 00:08:01.270
Huh?

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:07.880
Help... me... please!

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:10.450
Roan!

00:08:10.450 --> 00:08:12.110
Stand back.

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:14.620
Magnum...

00:08:17.090 --> 00:08:17.960
...Break!

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:27.130
Poring!

00:08:28.740 --> 00:08:32.270
Thank you very much.

00:08:32.270 --> 00:08:33.640
Oh my gosh!

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:35.300
Heal!

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:42.320
Thank you so much!

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:45.950
I thought Ma-<i>chan</i> was a goner!

00:08:45.950 --> 00:08:47.650
Poring!

00:08:50.860 --> 00:08:53.960
Allow me to introduce myself.
I'm Maaya, a merchant.

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:57.530
Call me Ma-<i>chan</i>!

00:08:57.530 --> 00:08:59.030
Merchant...

00:08:59.030 --> 00:09:01.000
...Ma-<i>chan.</i>

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:08.010
I'm so glad you rescued me...

00:09:08.010 --> 00:09:10.950
I went through spoa after spoa before finally finding a spoa doll,

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:14.050
but the roaches took it from me.

00:09:14.050 --> 00:09:19.490
I got so angry, I hit one.
That was my big mistake.

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:20.920
First there was one, then thirty.

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:24.060
They were all over my body in an instant.

00:09:24.060 --> 00:09:29.660
The feeling of having roaches crawling all over your face is just horrible...

00:09:29.660 --> 00:09:32.000
Stop it!

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:34.070
Oh, sorry...

00:09:34.070 --> 00:09:39.770
By the way, how far are you folks going?

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:41.880
Huh?

00:09:41.880 --> 00:09:47.050
If you came this far, you must be a couple?

00:09:47.050 --> 00:09:52.390
Maybe you've already...

00:09:52.390 --> 00:09:55.190
W-we've done no such thing!

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:56.990
Darn you! Darn!

00:09:59.430 --> 00:10:03.630
Not yet? Then I have just the thing!

00:10:03.630 --> 00:10:08.600
W-We're just childhood friends, and...

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:11.570
And so, you know...

00:10:11.570 --> 00:10:14.080
Darn these things!
Get away from me!

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:16.910
Hey! Heal me!

00:10:16.910 --> 00:10:21.150
This isn't it... not this...
--Roan does have his good points,

00:10:21.150 --> 00:10:26.620
but just maybe, I'll meet someone even better...

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:30.020
Hey! Heal me?

00:10:31.130 --> 00:10:33.360
Here it is!

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:37.900
For your wedding. You're not married yet, are you?

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:39.930
Is that what you meant?

00:10:39.930 --> 00:10:42.870
What did you think I meant?

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:45.200
Heal...

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:49.040
Heal!

00:10:56.820 --> 00:10:59.050
I thought I was going to die.

00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:00.960
Are you all right?

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:06.190
I have red potion, or would you prefer meat?

00:11:06.190 --> 00:11:11.470
Hold it! Why are you with us, anyway?

00:11:11.470 --> 00:11:14.990
It gets dangerous from here.
Go on home!

00:11:18.140 --> 00:11:20.980
Huh?

00:11:20.980 --> 00:11:23.080
It's always like this!

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:27.480
Everybody doesn't want
Ma-<i>chan</i> around!

00:11:27.480 --> 00:11:32.510
Everybody hates Ma-<i>chan</i>!

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:45.030
We're sorry. Please don't cry.

00:11:46.030 --> 00:11:47.200
Roan!

00:11:47.200 --> 00:11:52.940
Uh... Oh, all right! I get it!

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:54.180
Aha!

00:11:54.180 --> 00:11:56.040
Thank you!

00:11:57.310 --> 00:11:58.880
By the way, Big Bro,

00:11:58.880 --> 00:12:01.920
would you like to buy a white rose that never wilts?

00:12:01.920 --> 00:12:04.320
I'll make it cheap.

00:12:21.070 --> 00:12:24.340
Careful, this is the deepest area...

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:25.310
Okay.

00:12:25.310 --> 00:12:28.280
Ma-<i>chan</i>'s never been this far before.

00:12:28.280 --> 00:12:30.300
Right, Poi-Poi?

00:12:31.710 --> 00:12:33.510
Hey, keep it down!

00:12:33.510 --> 00:12:35.520
The monsters will notice us.

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:40.350
Sorry... But don't worry.
I have lots of items with me.

00:12:40.350 --> 00:12:44.860
Don't worry about recovering, okay?

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:49.660
I said keep it down!

00:12:49.660 --> 00:12:53.770
Ma-<i>chan</i> is really afraid, but I'm doing my best to hide it.

00:12:53.770 --> 00:12:58.710
I wanted to cheer the two of you up...

00:13:01.680 --> 00:13:03.640
P-Poring!

00:13:04.680 --> 00:13:06.310
Maaya-<i>chan</i>!

00:13:19.830 --> 00:13:21.130
Ha-ha!

00:13:21.130 --> 00:13:25.600
Those two made it easy to get this far.

00:13:25.600 --> 00:13:30.330
Now I wonder if there are any interesting items around...

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:47.560
Where could that girl have gone?

00:13:47.560 --> 00:13:50.460
She sure is a lot of trouble.

00:13:50.460 --> 00:13:54.300
It's your fault Roan, for getting angry!

00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:56.430
Yeah, but...

00:13:56.430 --> 00:14:00.030
And I thought we could go on this adventure alone...

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:02.960
Huh?
--What is it?

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:07.060
Poring!

00:14:07.980 --> 00:14:09.810
Maaya-<i>chan</i>!

00:14:09.810 --> 00:14:11.510
Here we go again...

00:14:11.510 --> 00:14:15.970
Big Bro! Big Sis! Help me!

00:14:26.460 --> 00:14:30.430
I stepped on the golden bug's head and now it's angry at me!

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:31.990
What?!

00:14:35.300 --> 00:14:37.000
Back me up!

00:14:41.310 --> 00:14:43.000
Blessing!

00:14:50.920 --> 00:14:52.450
Roan, you're awesome!

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:54.010
Oh...

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:03.290
Ugh!

00:15:05.070 --> 00:15:06.270
Heal!

00:15:06.270 --> 00:15:07.960
Thank you!

00:15:11.110 --> 00:15:12.630
Gotcha!

00:15:18.150 --> 00:15:19.640
Accelerate!

00:15:34.760 --> 00:15:36.160
Run!

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:48.010
Oh no!

00:15:50.610 --> 00:15:52.010
Look out!

00:15:58.090 --> 00:15:59.020
Huh?

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:04.260
D-Dammit!

00:16:04.260 --> 00:16:06.030
Roan!

00:16:06.030 --> 00:16:07.790
Heal!

00:16:09.430 --> 00:16:10.400
Huh?!

00:16:12.270 --> 00:16:14.340
Ugh!

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:18.640
Heal! Heal! Heal!

00:16:18.640 --> 00:16:19.970
Roan!

00:16:22.110 --> 00:16:24.980
No! You don't stand a chance!

00:16:31.190 --> 00:16:32.690
Roan!

00:16:32.690 --> 00:16:33.650
Huh?

00:16:44.470 --> 00:16:45.500
Roan!

00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:47.990
Roan, get ahold of yourself!

00:16:49.140 --> 00:16:51.330
Yuufa...

00:16:53.670 --> 00:16:56.680
I told her not to!

00:16:56.680 --> 00:16:57.670
Poring.

00:16:59.610 --> 00:17:01.010
Good idea!

00:17:04.350 --> 00:17:07.390
Um... not this one...

00:17:07.390 --> 00:17:10.390
Not this, either...

00:17:10.390 --> 00:17:12.590
Found it!

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:15.290
Poi-Poi, do your thing!

00:17:16.600 --> 00:17:20.300
P-Poring!

00:17:34.380 --> 00:17:36.320
Heal!

00:18:07.820 --> 00:18:08.940
Roan!

00:18:13.550 --> 00:18:15.790
You did it, kid!

00:18:15.790 --> 00:18:20.630
I never thought you'd strike the fatal blow.

00:18:20.630 --> 00:18:21.960
Huh?

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:28.960
This is the Golden Thief Bug card...

00:18:31.440 --> 00:18:34.110
This is your reward. Take it.

00:18:34.110 --> 00:18:36.010
You did well!

00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:37.640
Good work!

00:18:39.980 --> 00:18:44.980
Yes! Thank you! Thank you!

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:05.610
Yuufa... I exchanged the items for cash.

00:19:05.610 --> 00:19:07.100
Yuufa?

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:13.410
The shower's working...

00:19:13.410 --> 00:19:15.680
Think I'll shower, too...

00:19:36.640 --> 00:19:38.310
What's wrong?!

00:19:38.310 --> 00:19:42.780
Sis, Big Bro peeked while
Ma-<i>chan</i> was in the shower!

00:19:42.780 --> 00:19:45.310
What was that?!

00:19:45.310 --> 00:19:46.610
No, you've got it all wrong!

00:19:46.610 --> 00:19:49.420
What's she doing here in the first place?!

00:19:49.420 --> 00:19:53.490
We're going to be traveling together from now on.

00:19:53.490 --> 00:19:55.120
So I belong here, right?

00:19:55.120 --> 00:19:56.420
Poring!

00:19:56.420 --> 00:19:58.490
Traveling together?!

00:19:58.490 --> 00:20:01.600
That's right.
Maaya-<i>chan</i> is on her way to Geffen.

00:20:01.600 --> 00:20:04.570
So I thought she could travel with us.

00:20:04.570 --> 00:20:07.400
With us?

00:20:07.400 --> 00:20:10.940
Yup. Be good to me, Big Bro!

00:20:10.940 --> 00:20:15.030
Huh? Huh? Huh?!

00:20:51.550 --> 00:20:53.680
Can't stand this anymore!

00:20:53.680 --> 00:20:57.050
Iruga, Iruga, I can't kill 'em all!

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:15.000
Keough?!

00:21:16.770 --> 00:21:18.330
Keough?

00:21:36.520 --> 00:21:38.760
Who were those guys?

00:21:38.760 --> 00:21:41.460
What's the matter?

00:21:41.460 --> 00:21:43.020
Iruga?

00:21:55.980 --> 00:22:01.310
Just when I thought I could travel alone with Yuufa!

00:22:04.820 --> 00:22:08.390
Why're you sleeping over here?!

00:22:08.390 --> 00:22:13.030
...got the Angel hairband...

00:22:13.030 --> 00:22:16.130
Man, she really tosses in her sleep.

00:22:16.130 --> 00:22:18.330
So different from Yuufa.

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:44.910
<i>Unable to even find a way</i> <i>to regain the strength we lost</i>

00:22:45.890 --> 00:22:54.000
<i>Here we are, beneath this vast sky</i>

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:58.840
<i>The shining cradle of green</i>

00:22:58.840 --> 00:23:03.710
<i>Is a merry-go-round that</i> <i>will never stop turning</i>

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:08.480
<i>Greater than any jewel</i> <i>in this world</i>

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:12.820
<i>It is a precious treasure</i>

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:22.820
<i>The endless journey leads</i> <i>to our tomorrow</i>

00:23:31.740 --> 00:23:34.840
<i>I'm Devolte from Kapra Service.</i>

00:23:34.840 --> 00:23:38.150
<i>Our next story takes place in</i> <i>the magical city of Geffen....</i>

00:23:38.150 --> 00:23:40.010
<i>Time is running out!</i>

00:23:40.010 --> 00:23:42.580
<i>Next time: "I Believe!"</i>

00:23:42.580 --> 00:23:45.680
<i>We look forward to</i> <i>your joining us again.</i>
